{"segments": [{"start_ms": 13679, "duration_ms": 6921, "text": "I underestimated him because he was getting so close with his magic. I took a direct hit."}, {"start_ms": 20600, "duration_ms": 6599, "text": "Just as I thought."}, {"start_ms": 30190, "duration_ms": 6169, "text": "[music]"}, {"start_ms": 38820, "duration_ms": 3119, "text": "[music]"}, {"start_ms": 48239, "duration_ms": 6561, "text": "Exihan"}, {"start_ms": 50520, "duration_ms": 7600, "text": "Cheshire, I'm not even sure if he's really a magic user anymore. I never imagined it would go"}, {"start_ms": 54800, "duration_ms": 5599, "text": "this far. He's"}, {"start_ms": 60399, "duration_ms": 4680, "text": "quite tough, is it because of his shell? What a"}, {"start_ms": 81000, "duration_ms": 6360, "text": "fight. I'm barely able to stand. I feel like I'm going to"}, {"start_ms": 87360, "duration_ms": 5840, "text": "faint just from the flow of magic."}, {"start_ms": 95840, "duration_ms": 5480, "text": "I'm being pushed back."}, {"start_ms": 110600, "duration_ms": 5159, "text": "Why?"}, {"start_ms": 115759, "duration_ms": 5640, "text": "Who is this human?"}, {"start_ms": 137740, "duration_ms": 3310, "text": "[music]"}, {"start_ms": 145519, "duration_ms": 5080, "text": "This is a deadly"}, {"start_ms": 150599, "duration_ms": 6640, "text": "poison that I forged with my power by absorbing the surrounding marine life. You can no longer move."}, {"start_ms": 157239, "duration_ms": 5360, "text": "Now it's over for you."}, {"start_ms": 164640, "duration_ms": 4000, "text": "Humans die from"}, {"start_ms": 186239, "duration_ms": 7920, "text": "poison, but he's unharmed? At this point, nothing seems surprising. So he had a"}, {"start_ms": 194159, "duration_ms": 8440, "text": "trump card up his sleeve. That explains why he seemed so confident."}, {"start_ms": 203120, "duration_ms": 7440, "text": "But perhaps because my senses have improved, I can"}, {"start_ms": 207720, "duration_ms": 4239, "text": "read his emotions. I"}, {"start_ms": 211959, "duration_ms": 5881, "text": "can see his impatience. I feel the same way about myself. I have to"}, {"start_ms": 217840, "duration_ms": 3840, "text": "end this as quickly as possible, otherwise the"}, {"start_ms": 230560, "duration_ms": 8280, "text": "poison won't work. A test of strength is"}, {"start_ms": 234840, "duration_ms": 4000, "text": "pointless."}, {"start_ms": 253480, "duration_ms": 11530, "text": "[music]"}, {"start_ms": 280919, "duration_ms": 3000, "text": "Uh"}, {"start_ms": 292350, "duration_ms": 3120, "text": "[music]  He's just as fast as"}, {"start_ms": 311120, "duration_ms": 6120, "text": "me, and he's getting faster and faster."}, {"start_ms": 317240, "duration_ms": 5360, "text": "How is this possible?"}, {"start_ms": 359740, "duration_ms": 3269, "text": "[music]"}, {"start_ms": 372570, "duration_ms": 8629, "text": "[music]"}, {"start_ms": 379199, "duration_ms": 3621, "text": "It's an"}, {"start_ms": 381199, "duration_ms": 4771, "text": "upgrade"}, {"start_ms": 382820, "duration_ms": 3150, "text": "[music]"}, {"start_ms": 387880, "duration_ms": 3680, "text": "brawl. Is it some kind of"}, {"start_ms": 398840, "duration_ms": 6359, "text": "free power? What was that just"}, {"start_ms": 405840, "duration_ms": 5280, "text": "now? What was that"}, {"start_ms": 433160, "duration_ms": 6800, "text": "human? That human,"}, {"start_ms": 444080, "duration_ms": 4000, "text": "go!"}, {"start_ms": 448890, "duration_ms": 3160, "text": "[music]"}, {"start_ms": 470479, "duration_ms": 9361, "text": "Why? I was born stronger than anyone else. I'm supposed to"}, {"start_ms": 476280, "duration_ms": 8639, "text": "swallow everything and keep"}, {"start_ms": 479840, "duration_ms": 8600, "text": "growing towards it. I'm supposed to be a king. But I have to run away, I have to run away to"}, {"start_ms": 491199, "duration_ms": 8400, "text": "survive. Get as far away as possible, quickly, quickly, quickly, far"}, {"start_ms": 522880, "duration_ms": 5800, "text": "away! ["}, {"start_ms": 532450, "duration_ms": 3129, "text": "music]"}, {"start_ms": 538800, "duration_ms": 3290, "text": "[music]"}, {"start_ms": 547280, "duration_ms": 10230, "text": "[music]"}, {"start_ms": 560440, "duration_ms": 5639, "text": "They've run away. Did I win?"}, {"start_ms": 567279, "duration_ms": 5081, "text": "Song Hunter JA"}]}